EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Our payments have been being returned.  If you are having trouble making your payments we have the ability to adjust the payment if you have had a decrease in your receivables.  Pursuant to Section 2.3 of the Agreement, we are requesting a reconciliation to determine whether we have received an amount greater than the Purchased Percentage of your Future Receivables.  In order to process this request please provide us with the last two months of bank statements from your business account.  We need to receive those within the next five (5) days for us to process the reconciliation.  Once we receive the statements, we will process your request and notify you of any adjustment to the remittance amount going forward.

Please note, if we do not receive the bank statements within such time then you will be in breach of the terms of the Agreement.

We look forward to hearing from you.


Thank you,


{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
